  "title": "Refactor the preference \"singleton\" architecture",
  "description": "The preference API can be made a little more generic to handle other cases of preferences and their standalone files (like at the UI layer).  Take out the \"singleton globals\" in several of the preference APIs so that other \"preference trees\" can be created and use the preference API.",
